  "note": "Pearl white and gold, wrapped by a see-through starlight dragon: OpenAI panels on the whole cue (pearl white with gold lattice straps crossing round dark sapphire diamonds, a pale maple tip end, a dark navy snakeskin grip), gold collar and rings, a gold cap end with a glowing eight-point star gem. The 3D piece (pieces/celestial_dragon): a pearl dragon head with gold horns and lips, fangs and glowing eyes resting past the butt, a mane of blue energy, and its see-through energy body (two ForceField ribbons with Neon cores) coiling round the cue to the shaft.",
