      "prompt": "Lustrous pearl white (#FAFAF5) with a soft iridescent pearly sheen and faint swirls, covered edge to edge (from the very top to the very bottom of the image, no plain bands) by an even lattice of thin polished gold straps (#D4AF37) crossing in long X shapes, two rows of diamonds high, each diamond cell holding a small dark sapphire-navy diamond inlay (#1A2450) with a gold edge. No glow, no energy, no other shapes."
