      "prompt": "Left thin strip (the ring): plain polished gold (#D4AF37). The wrap (from the ring to the next zone line): a dark navy snakeskin grip (#141A30), small overlapping glossy scales. The butt sleeve (between the two zone lines on the right): lustrous pearl white with bold polished gold X straps framing dark sapphire-navy diamond inlays, and gold bands at both ends. The very thin strip at the far right: plain gold. No glow, no blue energy, no dragon."
